sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Claude as Claude Desktop
    participant MCP as Generated MCP Server
    participant PW as Playwright Runtime
    participant Site as Target Website

    User->>Claude: Where is Order #12345?

    Claude->>MCP: Invoke tool(order_id=12345)

    MCP->>PW: Launch browser context
    PW->>Site: Open login page
    Site-->>PW: Login page

    PW->>Site: Authenticate
    Site-->>PW: Dashboard

    PW->>Site: Enter Order ID
    PW->>Site: Submit lookup

    Site-->>PW: Shipment status page

    PW->>PW: Extract structured data

    PW-->>MCP: Return {status, carrier, expected_delivery}

    MCP->>MCP: Format response

    MCP-->>Claude: Structured tool response

    Claude-->>User: Order #12345 shipped via FedEx. Expected delivery: July 14.